  "verdict": "CONFIRMED. Both arms clear SIDE_STATUS_SPIKES_DAMAGED inside the switchineffects opcode (BattleScript_DoSwitchOut+32) after the entrant took its Spikes chip, and the third entrant WHISCASH takes 30 = 185/6 (two layers) in both arms. The Intimidate arm is not a special case on the ROM; it is one in the unfixed port.",
